<li><a href="/blog/unused-power-bi-licenses">Unused Power BI licenses</a></li>
<li><a href="/blog/why-power-bi-reports-show-different-numbers">Why Power BI reports show different numbers</a></li></ul>
  </div>
</section><section class="band band-cta" aria-labelledby="cta-heading">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kicker">Next step</p>
    <h2 id="cta-heading">Bring the report people complain about.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Book a session and we will look at that report with you.</p>
    <p class="hero-actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Book a Session</a></p>
  </div>
</section></article>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
